    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the tax law and chapter 535 of the laws of 1987, amending the\ntax law relating to the city of Yonkers personal income tax surcharge, in\nrelation to extending the expiration date of the personal income tax surcharge",
    "basePrintNo": "S4466",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4466-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
